  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Heat - introduction of efficient customer oriented small-grid district heating service based on renewable energy sources</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific objective(s):1. To introduce innovative, replicable model for small-grid district heating(DH) services by accelerating utilization of locally available resources2. To strengthen the capacities of the key actors having competencies forefficient transition to advanced and greener heating services at local level3. To promote utilization of climate-oriented, advanced solutions fordelivery of services that stimulate greener local economy</narrative>
  </description>
